# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Internal product thinking — deliberately NOT shared.
#
# What stays in the repo is what somebody needs in order to RUN, BUILD or
# INTEGRATE with this app: README.md, TECH.md, docs/build-status.md and
# docs/qa/. Everything below is our own working material — ideas, competitor
# research, screen audits, meeting agendas, planning specs. It changes weekly,
# it is argued over, and it is noise to anyone pulling this repo to build
# against it.
#
# These files still exist on disk; they are simply no longer tracked.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
docs/PRODUCT.md
docs/product/
docs/research/
docs/audit/
docs/discussion-guide.md
docs/decision-log.md
docs/superpowers/

example

# generated native folders
/ios
/android
